Added the role `work` (Work, area).
pace took these defaults: kind `area`, no purpose and no weekly target; `pace role edit` changes them.

----- stderr -----

$ pace project init --visible --key acme-webshop --name Webshop relaunch --role work --billable   # at 09:00 in work/webshop
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `acme-webshop` (Webshop relaunch) in the role `work`, billable.
Wrote the manifest pace.toml, which links this directory to the project.
pace took these defaults: no client; `pace project edit acme-webshop` changes them.

